    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if there is no way out? like you say \"step out of the shadows\" but there's nothing out there for me. i try to reach out but it's just... silence. it's like i'm already gone and i'm just waiting for my body to catch up. it feels more logical than anything else.",
